AFFILIATE INTEGRATION HUB
Create a normalized affiliate model:
AffiliateProvider
AffiliateAccount
Merchant
Product
ProductVariant
Offer
Commission
Promotion
Coupon
AffiliateLink
Campaign
Conversion
Order
Refund
Payout

Implement provider adapters:
TikTokAdapter
ShopeeAdapter
MetaAdapter
YouTubeAdapter
GenericAffiliateAdapter

Each adapter should declare capabilities:
catalog.read
offers.read
links.create
orders.read
commissions.read
content.publish
video.publish
image.publish
analytics.read
webhooks

Never assume every provider exposes every capability.

PRODUCT INTELLIGENCE ENGINE
Continuously ingest eligible products and calculate:
Affiliate Opportunity Score
Viral Potential Score
Commission Score
Conversion Score
Price Competitiveness
Promotion Strength
Content Fit
Audience Fit
Historical ROAS
Refund Risk
Inventory Risk

Create a configurable ranking model:
opportunity_score =
  commission_score
  * conversion_probability
  * trend_score
  * audience_fit
  * promotion_score
  * confidence

Do not optimize purely for commission.

TREND & VIRAL INTELLIGENCE
Build a trend intelligence pipeline from permitted data sources.
Detect:
- trending product categories
- search growth
- recurring hooks
- seasonal demand
- emerging keywords
- high-performing content formats
- audience questions
- successful video lengths
- engagement velocity
- historical channel performance

Generate TrendScore, TrendVelocity, TrendConfidence, TrendLifecycle.
Lifecycle: emerging, growing, peak, declining, evergreen.
Never manipulate trends or manufacture engagement.

AI CONTENT STRATEGIST
For each product automatically generate target persona, user problem, product benefit, differentiators, evidence-supported claims, hook, narrative, CTA, platform, format, duration, disclosure requirements.
Support: problem→solution, demo, tutorial, comparison, before/after where substantiated, FAQ, unboxing, feature spotlight, use case, listicle, story, educational, deal/promotion.

COPY GENERATION ENGINE
Generate titles, captions, descriptions, hooks, scripts, voiceover scripts, subtitles, thumbnail copy, hashtags, CTA, SEO keywords, product descriptions.
Support Thai, English, Thai + English.
Brand voice: professional, premium, friendly, educational, energetic, minimal, luxury, creator.
All product claims must be grounded.

IMAGE GENERATION PIPELINE
Generate product promotion creatives, vertical story graphics, feed posts, thumbnails, banners, comparison graphics, sale graphics, quote cards, carousel assets.
Use templates with product, price, promotion, CTA, brand, logo, background, headline, disclosure.
Ratios: 9:16, 1:1, 4:5, 16:9.

AUTOMATED VIDEO FACTORY
Pipeline:
Research → Script → Storyboard → Asset Selection/Generation → Voiceover → Scene Assembly → Captions → Music/SFX → Branding → CTA → Disclosure → Render → QA → Publish Queue
Support 9:16, 16:9, 1:1 and 10/15/20/30/45/60 sec configurable durations.

VIRAL VIDEO VARIATION ENGINE
Generate controlled variations across hooks, first frame, title, thumbnail, narrative, duration, CTA, caption, voice, pacing.
Track immutable creative IDs.

HUMAN APPROVAL & AUTONOMY LEVELS
MANUAL
DRAFT_ONLY
APPROVAL_REQUIRED
AUTO_PUBLISH_APPROVED_TEMPLATES
AUTONOMOUS_WITH_POLICY

Sensitive/high-risk categories require human approval.

MULTI-PLATFORM PUBLISHING ENGINE
Normalized publish(content, destinations, schedule).
Support drafts, scheduling, publishing, retries, idempotency, rate limiting, token refresh, webhook reconciliation, status polling where permitted, dead-letter queues, partial failure recovery.
Never silently treat failed publication as success.

CONTENT CALENDAR
Statuses:
IDEA
GENERATING
REVIEW
APPROVED
SCHEDULED
PUBLISHING
PUBLISHED
FAILED
ARCHIVED

SMART AFFILIATE LINKS
/go/{slug}
Track affiliate destination, campaign, content ID, platform, source, medium, creative ID, UTM, expiration, provider metadata.

ATTRIBUTION ENGINE
Impression → Engagement → Click → Affiliate Redirect → Conversion → Commission → Refund → Net Revenue
Calculate CTR, CVR, EPC, Revenue, Commission, Refund Rate, Net Commission, RPM, ROAS, Content ROI, Product ROI, Platform ROI.

LEARNING LOOP
Learn which products, hooks, formats, platforms, publishing windows, CTAs, and audience/product pairs work.
Use minimum-sample thresholds and confidence intervals.

EXPERIMENTATION ENGINE
Support Hook, Thumbnail, Caption, CTA, Video length, Template, Posting time, Product, Audience segment experiments.
Track Experiment, Variant, Exposure, Metric, Confidence, Winner.

AUTONOMOUS CAMPAIGN LOOP
Discover → Rank → Select → Create campaign → Generate assets → Policy check → Human approval if required → Schedule → Publish → Measure → Attribute → Learn → Generate next hypothesis

