CI: lint, typecheck, unit, integration, contract, security, dependency scan, secret scan, SAST, container scan, build, SBOM, artifact signing, deployment, smoke tests.
Never disable security gates to obtain green CI.

TESTING
unit, integration, E2E, contract, provider-adapter, webhook, queue, failure/retry, security, tenant-isolation, load, media, publishing, attribution.
External providers use mocked/sandbox contract tests.

FAILURE DESIGN
Handle provider unavailable, API changed, token revoked, rate limited, upload rejected, render failed, partial multi-platform publish, webhook duplication/reordering, duplicate conversion, promotion expired, product removed, price changed, affiliate link expired, AI unavailable, queue outage, database failover.

