EXECUTION RULE
At every iteration inspect repo, read exec-planning.md, inspect PRs/CI, select highest-priority bounded incomplete item, verify deps, test-first where practical, implement minimum change, run tests/security, update docs/checklist/changelog, report exactly what changed and next bounded item.
Never mark unverified work complete.
Never merge, deploy, spend money, publish externally, or enable irreversible autonomous behavior without required authorization.

FINAL OBJECTIVE
Build a policy-controlled autonomous affiliate commerce and content operating system capable of discovering opportunities, producing multilingual creative assets, coordinating compliant multi-platform publishing, measuring real commercial outcomes, learning from performance, and continuously improving while maintaining human control, security, auditability, and provider-policy compliance.
